WEBVTT

00:04:26.039 --> 00:04:30.022
And one of the tools I like personally is using video.

00:04:30.022 --> 00:04:32.472
So I was inspired by a friend.

00:04:32.472 --> 00:04:34.721
This is Allan Okrainec from Toronto.

00:04:34.721 --> 00:04:37.326
And he proved

00:04:37.326 --> 00:04:41.572
that you could actually teach people to do surgery

00:04:41.572 --> 00:04:44.272
using video conferencing.

00:04:44.272 --> 00:04:48.505
So here's Allan teaching an English-speaking surgeon in Africa

00:04:48.505 --> 00:04:51.055
these basic fundamental skills

00:04:51.055 --> 00:04:53.772
necessary to do minimally invasive surgery.

00:04:53.772 --> 00:04:55.372
Very inspiring.

00:04:55.372 --> 00:04:59.138
But for this examination, which is really hard,

00:04:59.138 --> 00:05:01.955
we have a problem.